<title>FRANCE: Lagardere has 4.5 bln ffr missile order.</title>
<headline>Lagardere has 4.5 bln ffr missile order.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lagardere Groupe said on Friday it had received a 4.5 billion franc order for 420 missiles from the French government.  </p>
<p>The announcement was made during the annual general meeting of shareholders. The type of missiles or date of order was not communicated.</p>
</text>
